#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/msdns.rst:57
msgid ""
"In some environments, |morpheus| may not be allowed to access the DNS "
"servers directly, as they may be on segregated networks.  In this case, "
"|morpheus| can utilize a member server as a \"jump box\" that can access "
"the DNS servers directly, the jump box will be used to interact with the "
"DNS server instead.  If this is a requirement, follow the below process "
"to prepare the jump box."
msgstr ""
"In algunos entornos, |morpheus| no puede be allowed to acceso el DNS "
"servers directly, as they puede be on segregated networks.  In este case,"
" |morpheus| puede utilize un member server as un \"jump box\" que puede "
"acceso el DNS servers directly, el jump box se utilizará to interact con "
"el DNS server en cambio.  If este es un requirement, follow el a "
"continuación proceso to prepare el jump box."

